<h1>My Wishes for You This Christmas!</h1><br/><br/><strong>
<br/>
May your Christmas be wrapped <br/>
In the warmth of His Real Presence <br/>
May your heart be stuffed full<br/>
Of merciful Love, His Living Essence<br/>
And may your precious soul be guided by<br/>
A Star lit with Heavenly Luminesence!<br/>
<br/>
May your New Year be decorated <br/>
With colorful joy and hopeful radiance<br/>
May the bubbly wonder of His Birth burst<br/>
Forth in this world with His peaceful ambience<br/>
And may our Blessed Mother Mary<br/>
Be your shield against all angry violence!<br/>
</strong>
